Bind Npc 24417 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910127000
        Say "I am Chatsra, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! You have the [Written Order] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What is the name of the village in Karus mainland where plain-faced and malicious monsters who dwell in herds in caves or under the mines?"
            Topic "Goblin Village" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910127000
                    Give 1 of 910128000
            Topic "Gavolt Village" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910127000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Written Order] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Chatsra, the first [Watchman of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order]."
    Else
        Say ""
